| !Run for Bluetooth: the icon bar task.  It loads BluetoothVoice and the
| USB driver from <Bluetooth$Dir>.Modules when the loaded copies are older.
Set Bluetooth$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Bluetooth$Dir>.!Sprites
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad <Bluetooth$Dir>.Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Bluetooth needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
WimpSlot -min 1024K -max 1024K
Run <Bluetooth$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
